    "reviews": "\u201cProjected Dreams offers a soothing experience full of clever shadow mechanics and a poignant reminder that time is precious.\u201d<br>KeenGamer<br><br>\u201cThere\u2019s a pleasant puzzler in Projected Dreams, thanks to its visuals, music, and simple game design.\u201d<br>Xbox Era<br><br>\u201c\u2018Projected Dreams\u2019 is one of the coziest puzzle games I\u2019ve ever played, with no timer to stress me out\u201d<br>Vice<br>",
